# Curator of Destinies: the opponent sees what is in the face-up pile and only how many cards the face-down one holds
# (CR 700.3). Bot1 looks at the top five (Lightning Bolt, Plains, Counterspell, Forest, Mountain) and makes the Bolt and the
# Plains the face-down pile. Bot2 takes the face-down pile for Bot1: the Bolt and the Plains go to Bot1's hand, never
# revealed, and the face-up Counterspell, Forest and Mountain, revealed to every player, to its graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Curator of Destinies
Black Lotus
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Plains
Counterspell
Forest
Mountain
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Curator of Destinies.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Plains)
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot2)
Bot2.Modes(Face-down pile)

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Lightning Bolt; Plains
Bot1.Graveyard = Mountain; Forest; Counterspell; Black Lotus
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
Bot1.Revealed = Counterspell; Forest; Mountain
